            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>Powered by patented BlendTek™ technology, our bedding is made from a carefully balanced mix of fibers engineered for breathability and moisture-wicking comfort, helping you enjoy a cooler, more refreshing sleep.<br/></p><p><strong>BlendTek™ Fabric:</strong> 69% Nylon, 20% Polyester, 11% Spandex</p><p><strong>Gentle on Skin</strong></p><p>Every item bearing the OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 label is certified as having passed safety tests for harmful substances.</p>",
